window.THINGS = [{"n":1,"title":"Your laugh.","text":"I’ve heard it a thousand times and it still makes me smile and laugh. Seeing you happy is the best thing ever, and making you laugh is one of my favourite things in the whole world. It’s the most beautiful sound and I could never get enough of it. I’m so happy I have someone who laughs with me, and who’s always laughing right by my side.","photo":"e28"},{"n":2,"title":"The face you make when you win an argument.","text":"Which is most of them. Nobody can argue with you, because you’re the bestest and most rightest person in the world. (The only person who can argue with you is me, and I still can’t win.)","photo":"e10"},{"n":3,"title":"You tell me the truth.","text":"You always keep a check on me: the gym, studying, and me. Nobody makes me better the way you do. You’re always by my side, looking after me and making sure I’m doing the right thing. I’m so happy I have someone like you who’s always there, standing by me and keeping me in check. Love you.","photo":"e30"},{"n":4,"title":"You’re calm when I’m not.","text":"When I want to fight the whole world, you’re right there next to me saying “let them bark, we move on.” You’re always there helping me make the right decisions and sorting things out, between me and you and everything else. Always calm when I’m not.","photo":"e25"},{"n":5,"title":"The thousand nicknames.","text":"MD, my veg boy, totla, Batman, best friend. I love every single one, and I’m so happy you made me answer to all of them. And you’re my Catwoman, my birthday girl, my Elaika, and the bestest, most amazing girlfriend in the world.","photo":"e15"},{"n":6,"title":"The letters you write me.","text":"Thank you for every letter you’ve ever written me. No one writes better than you. I’m so grateful I have someone who makes me feel special all the time, and says it in her own words.","photo":null},{"n":7,"title":"My Thai girl, my American girl, my Mumbai girl.","text":"And my girl. Somehow you manage to be all of them, perfectly. I’m so happy that you’re you.","photo":null},{"n":8,"title":"Wordle is a sport to you.","text":"Connections, Strands, the Mini. You play them like there’s prize money, so I made you your own.","photo":"e29"},{"n":9,"title":"You notice everything.","text":"You make me feel special without me having to say anything. You always know when I’m mad, when I’m sad, when I’m grumpy, and you always know how to make me happy again. Thank you for noticing.","photo":null},{"n":10,"title":"You’re my Nutella girl.","text":"In ninth grade I used to bring Nutella breadsticks to school for you, and I told you I didn’t even eat Nutella. That was a lie. I just wanted to give them to you. Now we have the Nutella crepe at Kitchen Garden. Nutella has always been part of us.","photo":null},{"n":11,"title":"Our music.","text":"Rolling Loud is what got us talking. Then came our video to “You” by Lloyd in the car, “Raindance”, and a 99% Spotify blend, because Batman and Catwoman obviously have the same amazing taste.","photo":"e31"},{"n":12,"title":"Baby pink.","text":"Everything you love turns baby pink. I’m navy blue. We match better than we should.","photo":"e02"},{"n":13,"title":"You’re the friendliest person ever.","text":"You always meet and greet all my friends, and I can’t thank you enough for that. You’re so welcoming with my family and everyone I love, just the way you are. I’m so happy I have someone like you by my side.","photo":"e20"},{"n":14,"title":"Our Italian food era.","text":"Our love for Italian food, and how much I love eating with you. We both order way too much and can never finish it, every single time, and I wouldn’t change a thing.","photo":"e07"},{"n":15,"title":"My Catwoman.","text":"You’re my Catwoman, and I’m your Batman. Always by my side, and ready to fight anyone standing right next to me. Gotham doesn’t stand a chance.","photo":"e06"},{"n":16,"title":"We keep it between us.","text":"We sort things out privately, and we never go to sleep upset. That is rare, and it’s ours.","photo":null},{"n":17,"title":"You let me chase you.","text":"Not jog, not walk, chase. Six years of almosts and you still said yes. Best thing I’ve ever done.","photo":"e18"}];
window.LETTER = {"greeting":"E,","body":["Happy 17th birthday. I’ve restarted this letter about nine times, which you’ll find funny, because you’re the one who’s good at writing and I’m the one who sends “love youuu soooo much” with four typos in it.","So here’s the simple version. A long time ago, a kid at Oberoi in neon glasses decided you were the coolest, hottest and most amazing person in the building. He was right. He just took a very long time to do anything about it. We started talking, stopped, started again, stopped again, and then one day it finally stuck.","I’ve been grateful for that every single day. Grateful that you replied to my note, grateful that I accepted your follow request, and so grateful to God that I saw your deleted message. I’m so grateful to Pinny Auntie, Zoran Uncle and God for giving me you, and for giving the world someone as beautiful and amazing as you.","This year you’ve been my favourite person to do absolutely everything with, from our Italian dinners we can never finish to the random nights that turn into the best ones. You always make me better. You push me about every single thing, you always stand by me, you tell me the things I don’t want to hear, you never let me settle for less, and you open my eyes to everything. You stand by me and tell me everything’s going to be all right.","And it’s not just me. You make everyone around you feel at home. You’re kind, you’re funny, you’re the smartest person in any room, and you light up every place you walk into. Seventeen looks so good on you. I hope this year gives you everything you’ve been working for, and that you start seeing yourself the way everyone who loves you sees you.","I’m so happy I have someone in my life who’s ready to stand by me through anything and everything. I love you the most. This year, forever, and till my last breath, you’ll be my favourite person to do every single thing with. I want to travel the world with you, Paris for you and Greece for me, and explore everything together.","Happy birthday, baby. I love you more than any words on a page could ever cover."],"closing":"Yours, always,","sign":"M"};
